  "limits": [
    "This is crop readability work within the approved camp growth design, not a whole-map, combat, economic or performance acceptance.",
    "The same earned character used ordinary native CUA movement, gathering, searching, eating and production. Source save was consistently backed up without identity, HP, coordinates, inventory or clock edits; offline breaks and model delays remain.",
    "Exactly60000ms separates observed start and readyAt. Collection happened208769ms after readyAt. This verifies normal maturation, not collection exactly at60s or novice pacing.",
    "Native growth and first maturity used sRvRlhzj, then one farm-badge opacity-only polish produced acceptedCDVz-sSl. Accepted actual mature/collect/empty and southeast readability were reverified; no claim of a fresh growing crop on that final polish build.",
    "Renderer/HUD tests cover destroyed fields, member job visibility, hidden jobs, exact readyAt, distant/current-target labels and no mutation/request. Only potatoes and intact owner field were natively played; geometry remains ordinary depth-sorted and can be partially hidden by people.",
    "The first accepted-build north capture was dark. Subsequent native southeast and collection/empty frames worked. Immediate-capture timing is a possible explanation, not a proven diagnosis, and the original user black-screen/freeze issue is not declared fixed.",
    "Final accepted page exported errors[] and all6 slow frames, maxdraw48.8ms/maxRAF81ms. Closed earlier candidate and growth pages were not exported; no all-pages error-free, fullP95, GPU, physical presentation, browser800MB or long-memory improvement claim.",
    "An unrelated existing resource defect was discovered: unanchored axe_stone matching includes pickaxe_stone. Actual equipped pick gathered3wood despite its no-wood-bonus description. This display commit preserves historical paid assets and does not fix that rule; a separate gathering correction remains required.",
    "All last seed and2wood2scrap were spent; final seed0 and1wood require renewed exploration before another crop. No seed-return/self-sufficiency or long-run balance claim. Only core plus paid farm exist, no defensive readiness.",
    "QA-only errors from incomplete Canvas mock, optional-property and Map fixture types, wrong negative runner shell path, and a close-button selector after auto-closing camp entry remain in logs/stages; they are not counted as product rendering exceptions.",
    "Mobile globalHUD crowding, full crop sprite variety, seed routes/workbench/storage/defense, cold-ground stalls, strict continuous60seconds and multiplayer/full-world goals remain active.",
    "Ordinary push is not deployment. Owned service/tabs were cleaned up; actual production data/sdc.sqlite was never opened."
  ],
